id: destructive-weather
name: Destructive Weather
advancement: true
prerequisite: Tier of Power 4+
tpCost: 10
weatherCataclysmic: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Weather Summoning at the Cataclysmic Tier for 4(bT) more.
text: >
  Destructive Weather: When you create foul weather, the effects are apocalyptic.
  –Prerequisites: Tier of Power 4+
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: You may increase the Ki Point Cost of this Unique Ability by 4(bT) upon using it so your Battle Weather’s
  Weather Tier is Cataclysmic.
